  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvpauqq0nfu3yf0acxzpnocpx@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1920\" data-video-height=\"1080\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvpauqq0nfu3yf0acxzpnocpx/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33313265244&amp;signature=y55MtfBvL42hMpc3N6lYQVicnus%3D&amp;ts=1756356444\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvpauqq0nfu3yf0acxzpnocpx?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cGF1cXEwbmZ1M3lmMGFjeHpwbm9jcHgiLCJ0aWQiOiJkMzljYjdiMi1lNTIzLTRmYzItOGQ1OC1kYWFlYTdlM2VkNDYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODE4OTh9.JWQXzMrASRwXm46WtkRBchgXwGZmQ7gKciL3Qx4GXBywselZzmPn8d_DTebNsxFxu6PHh0Us7MjvvdmVBceykQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">원자번호 66번 디스프로슘은 퀴리 온도가 88 K(-185 °C)이라서 액체질소에 넣으면 강자성을 띠다 상온에서는 상자성을 띱니다. 그래서 액체질소에 넣으면 자석에 잘 붙는데 공기중에서 시간이 지나먼 자석에서 떨어지는 것을 실험으로 보여줬습니다.<br><br>영상 보시면 알겠지만 아이들이 하나둘셋얍 하면서 디스프로슘 조각이 떨어지길 기다리는게 너무나도 귀엽네요.</p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends1\" data-emoticon-name=\"004\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"true\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/004.gif\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/004.gif\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5a7a4d908a515f265e8b18bf1521f95190b1837\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5a7a4d908a515f265e8b18bf1521f95190b1837\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"356\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
